<title>BELGIUM: EU to rule on Clabecq aid within weeks.</title>
<headline>EU to rule on Clabecq aid within weeks.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission will rule within weeks on a proposed 1.5 billion Belgian franc capital injection to rescue steel maker Forges de Clabecq, European Competition Commissioner Karel Van Miert said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Commission will have to take a decision. It's a matter of weeks,&quot; Van Miert told Belgian radio RTBF in answer to a question.</p>
<p>The Commission said in September that the capital injection together with other measures consisting of a bridging loan and a waiving of claims amounted to state subsidies which can only be allowed under very strict circumstances.</p>
<p>-- 322 2876841</p>
</text>
